{
  "description": "Cross-language HITL approval FINGERPRINT vectors. expected = APPROVAL_FINGERPRINT_VERSION + ':' + hex(HMAC-SHA256(key, canonicalForm)), where canonicalForm is canonicalToolActionJson of the input. The key is the UTF-8 bytes of `key`. Go/Java editions must reproduce every `expected`.",
